        <mxCell id="kin8JDmjudevwgKuWIJU-14" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Starts a list of general information, as a diary.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Starts to look for state secrets. She starts her research with Temothy in the public library.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="1720" y="10" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kin8JDmjudevwgKuWIJU-17" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Some event that allows for a slip in state secrets, security wise.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Ball seems fitting, idk&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="1760" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kin8JDmjudevwgKuWIJU-25" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Mid - Year Ball&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Maze is told her father&#39;s ability (Margo), and about her mother being apart of a rebellion (Temothy).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Naveen sneaks away to get into the kings library, was supposed to go with Temothy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Show off new years to the whole university:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- &lt;/span&gt;Fight between Justin and Timothy&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- Then Kiss &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Margo shields herself and has second coming, along with maze&#39;s identity. Maze then kills her&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Atticus admits to ruling all the kingdoms as puppets and for taking Temothy because he wanted to, but that it was his brothers idea, and he rather has his brother on the throne.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="320" x="1326" y="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
